00:39:46.044 --> 00:39:48.012
Actually my team mates here.


00:39:48.026 --> 00:39:50.022
Stole the ball, otherwise
i wouldnt have had a chance.


00:39:50.044 --> 00:39:55.034
Oh your much to modest, Troy.
You were voted MVP for the entire season.


00:39:57.059 --> 00:40:00.089
This year positively screams for a winning season.


00:40:01.060 --> 00:40:03.051
Thank you.
Let me get that for you.


00:40:08.089 --> 00:40:11.069
They have got a heck of a basketball
program over at the university.


00:40:11.086 --> 00:40:13.074
Its got an excellent scholarship
program as well.


00:40:13.091 --> 00:40:15.054
Scholarship?


00:40:15.088 --> 00:40:21.027
Yeah, you know between the two of us here
we pull quite a bit of weight over at the school.


00:40:23.035 --> 00:40:27.000
Well time flies when
your are having fun.


00:40:27.038 --> 00:40:30.042
But Mr Fulton will probably want
me clocking out at the minute.


00:40:30.060 --> 00:40:33.017
Oh come on dont be silly,
you havent even had any dessert.


00:40:33.036 --> 00:40:36.007
We havent talked about golf yet?
Basketball and golf are just......


00:40:36.028 --> 00:40:40.017
..... the beginning of Troy, daddy.
Have you heard him sing?


00:40:40.060 --> 00:40:41.070
ohhh a triple threat.


00:40:41.095 --> 00:40:45.006
Oh how wonderful, Troy can
participate in the talent show.


00:40:45.029 --> 00:40:47.053
Come on, Troy why dont you
give them a sample. Kelsi!


00:40:49.082 --> 00:40:54.040
Actually my voice is feeling a little
bit horse tonight. With all the talking but....


00:40:54.056 --> 00:40:59.033
...... Thank you very much for the
food and the golf and everything, it was amazing.


00:40:59.050 --> 00:41:04.073
You will sing some other time wont you,
with me?... promise?


00:41:11.033 --> 00:41:13.044
Promise.
Perfect.


00:41:15.057 --> 00:41:16.042
Dessert?


00:41:38.035 --> 00:41:40.023
Sorry I am late give
me 2 more minutes.


00:41:40.040 --> 00:41:43.017
Nice tie.
Your shoes dont match though.


00:41:43.035 --> 00:41:44.018
Kidding.


00:41:50.056 --> 00:41:55.009
Honey, 2 minutes is being late.
but hour? is approaching a felony.


00:41:55.026 --> 00:41:57.020
Just because Troy is a nice guy
doesnt mean he is immune.....


00:41:57.040 --> 00:41:59.000
to Boy Disease.
Boy Disease?


00:41:59.019 --> 00:42:00.084
Yeah, forgetting things he shouldnt forget.


00:42:01.002 --> 00:42:03.005
Now your a boy expert?
My older sister,


00:42:03.025 --> 00:42:05.015
Has ten rules about
boys behaviour.


00:42:05.044 --> 00:42:08.037
and 9 of them involve boys forgetting
things they should never forget.


00:42:08.054 --> 00:42:12.009
like dinner dates.
Well it wasnt an official date type of thing.


00:42:12.030 --> 00:42:16.023
Rule number 3 :
ALL dates are official.


00:42:16.042 --> 00:42:18.010
whether the boy knows it or not.


00:42:38.008 --> 00:42:40.028
HEY..... Lifeguard!


00:42:43.084 --> 00:42:45.065
Your crazy, Wildcat.


00:42:46.051 --> 00:42:50.010
Im so late. but I have bought
food a couple of candles.....


00:42:50.031 --> 00:42:52.072
.... im going to throw a pool side picnic.
what do you say?


00:42:52.089 --> 00:42:56.072
Zeke, even made us some desserts.
But first I dare you to jump in.


00:42:56.095 --> 00:43:00.063
You know we are not meant
to be in the pool.   ...Club rules!


00:43:03.085 --> 00:43:04.078
Cramp!


00:43:06.043 --> 00:43:10.002
I need a lifeguard.
Help! Rescue me!


00:43:10.073 --> 00:43:11.064
Save me!


00:43:13.048 --> 00:43:14.045
Here I come!


00:43:29.004 --> 00:43:31.072
If your coming in. Follow me.


00:44:00.041 --> 00:44:01.021
listen?


00:44:04.073 --> 00:44:05.060
you know.....


00:44:06.099 --> 00:44:08.049
....here now with you....


00:44:10.015 --> 00:44:12.039
... its finally starting
to feel like summer.


00:44:13.070 --> 00:44:15.012
Yeah, it is.


00:44:18.028 --> 00:44:22.027
the waterbugs are back!
Look Mr Fulton this was my idea.....


00:44:22.046 --> 00:44:25.006
.... she had nothing to do with it.
I generously over looked your....


00:44:25.025 --> 00:44:29.006
... previous break violation, but then came the golf course trip.


00:44:29.024 --> 00:44:36.069
and now.... comes this, 2 strikes.
Dont get a third!


00:44:36.095 --> 00:44:38.017
Out of the pool.


00:44:43.066 --> 00:44:45.099
Sharpays dad let me play a few holes,


00:44:46.016 --> 00:44:48.015
and then invited me to dinner
with some of the university board.


00:44:48.031 --> 00:44:49.007
Really?


00:44:49.024 --> 00:44:50.094
They were talking about scholarships.


00:44:51.009 --> 00:44:53.074
While Jason and Chad
were like serving me.


00:44:54.062 --> 00:44:56.051
Your getting paid for it.
its called a job.


00:44:56.067 --> 00:44:57.087
You were invited,
There is nothing wrong with that.


00:44:58.004 --> 00:45:00.028
I dont know, it felt wierd.


00:45:00.074 --> 00:45:03.031
I love that you have got
the team working together.


00:45:03.047 --> 00:45:06.022
But your not going to be a Wildcat forever.
The team is now.


00:45:06.039 --> 00:45:09.081
and that is good but
everyone has there own future.


00:45:10.093 --> 00:45:12.035
Im not sure I know what you mean.


00:45:16.032 --> 00:45:18.097
Well, when you graduate lots
of people will be chasing....


00:45:19.015 --> 00:45:20.042
.... the same opportunities.


00:45:20.057 --> 00:45:22.087
There is nothing wrong with
keeping your eye on the prize.


00:45:23.007 --> 00:45:26.072
In fact if you dont, you will get left behind.
Yeah I know, im just saying....


00:45:26.088 --> 00:45:30.093
I didnt get my friends jobs so they
could sit and watch me eat in the dining room.


00:45:31.010 --> 00:45:34.066
Im just saying that you should never be ashamed
of attention as long as you have earned it.


00:45:34.087 --> 00:45:37.094
A scholarship is special.
That is why there are only a few of them around.


00:45:38.011 --> 00:45:39.090
I get it, Dad.


00:45:44.083 --> 00:45:48.015
So how was the food at Lava Springs?
Insanely good.


00:45:50.044 --> 00:45:52.052
Take it out for a spin.
No way?


00:45:52.069 --> 00:45:55.003
Well you didnt think I was
going to drive this heap, did you?


00:45:59.026 --> 00:46:02.016
Ok, bring those knees up as high
as you can and circle those arms


00:46:02.033 --> 00:46:05.055
Hey waterbug.
Last night was so fun,


00:46:05.072 --> 00:46:07.050
.... I really didnt mean to get you in trouble.
Same here.


00:46:07.068 --> 00:46:11.058
So maybe later we can have our....
TROY!


00:46:14.005 --> 00:46:16.001
So what time is your lunch break?


00:46:17.013 --> 00:46:18.085
TROY!


00:46:19.030 --> 00:46:20.092
Half past 1
Half past 1, great.


00:46:21.009 --> 00:46:22.068
Cheeseburgers are on me.


00:46:22.084 --> 00:46:24.093
Everyone it looks great
Awesome job.


00:46:25.008 --> 00:46:26.026
Jumping Jacks!


00:46:28.068 --> 00:46:30.062
What is she up too?


00:46:31.024 --> 00:46:34.058
Who knows?
Believe me, she does.


00:46:38.048 --> 00:46:41.025
I am sorry I am late Mr Fulton.
About the pool thing last night....


00:46:41.043 --> 00:46:44.007
...you cant blame Gabriella.
Im promoting you.


00:46:44.026 --> 00:46:46.023
Your what?
There is an opening as an assistant....


00:46:46.047 --> 00:46:49.062
to golf pros
Salary job, no clocking in,


00:46:49.080 --> 00:46:53.065
at 500 dollars a week,  plus tips.


00:46:54.002 --> 00:46:59.046
What? per week?
Oh my.... That is off the hook.....


00:47:00.016 --> 00:47:01.087
... I think it sounds very natural.


00:47:02.046 --> 00:47:03.044
Shall we?


00:47:11.071 --> 00:47:15.019
Wait so you want me to teach golf?
To kids.


00:47:15.040 --> 00:47:16.035
Oh the joy.


00:47:16.057 --> 00:47:19.016
Sir, I dont think
i am qualified.


00:47:19.042 --> 00:47:22.094
Worry not, just show the little angels
which end of the club to hold,


00:47:23.016 --> 00:47:26.079
Tee the ball up and then duck!
In addition,


00:47:27.002 --> 00:47:30.005
the board is extending
membership privileges to you.


00:47:30.025 --> 00:47:32.059
You have complete use of club facilities.


00:47:32.075 --> 00:47:38.014
But do so prudently.
Which means hello wildacts, NOT!


00:47:40.037 --> 00:47:41.032
Congratulations.


00:47:42.054 --> 00:47:44.097
You will find an appropriate
choice of clothing here.


00:47:45.018 --> 00:47:48.018
Do not mix checks with plaids or
blue with browns...


00:47:48.035 --> 00:47:50.071
...and above all wearing
white socks at all costs.


00:47:50.089 --> 00:47:52.058
Leave you shoes outside you locker.


00:47:52.076 --> 00:47:54.033
We will have them polished each evening.


00:47:58.035 --> 00:47:59.019
Man.


00:47:59.099 --> 00:48:02.085
Save it for the first tee.
To get there.


00:48:04.006 --> 00:48:08.083
This might come in handy,
that is the key to your golf cart.


00:48:09.005 --> 00:48:14.017
Number 14. The same number
that is on your basketball uniform.


00:48:14.036 --> 00:48:16.091
So I am told.
Questions?


00:48:17.011 --> 00:48:18.078
How did this happen?


00:48:19.070 --> 00:48:21.092
It would seem that the evans family
Thinks you have...


00:48:22.010 --> 00:48:24.014
... untapped potential.


00:48:24.042 --> 00:48:29.055
Young man,
the future is full of uncharted waters.


00:48:29.075 --> 00:48:35.000
This family has real pull.
So I suggest you take the ride.


00:48:44.025 --> 00:48:45.003
Italian.


00:48:45.020 --> 00:48:48.039
Awesome junior golfers,
you guys look amazing!


00:48:48.056 --> 00:48:53.067
Slow down champ, slow down.
Save some for the other kids.


00:48:53.083 --> 00:48:56.043
There you go.
Cool shorts, buddy.


00:48:57.021 --> 00:48:58.006
Alright.


00:48:58.024 --> 00:49:03.009
Hey cutie. Try holding the club that way,
you will hit the ball way further.


00:49:05.097 --> 00:49:08.076
Nice back swing, nice back swing killer.


00:49:08.096 --> 00:49:10.040
Make the ball fear you.


00:49:10.069 --> 00:49:13.080
You look good, great job everybody.
GREAT JOB GUYS.


00:49:13.099 --> 00:49:15.040
Bolton, Bolton.


00:49:15.057 --> 00:49:16.088
Your Half 11 is here
Thanks.


00:49:17.006 --> 00:49:17.077
Good luck buddy.


00:49:24.057 --> 00:49:25.022
Man!


00:49:28.004 --> 00:49:28.097
Cool Balls!


00:49:29.013 --> 00:49:30.070
Thanks.
Your welcome.


00:49:30.088 --> 00:49:34.017
By the end of the summer,
you will have me playing like a pro.


00:49:36.018 --> 00:49:38.049
Yeah right, if I live that long.


00:49:41.082 --> 00:49:44.037
I am so excited about the show,


00:49:44.059 --> 00:49:46.032
Dont worry, we will find something great to do.


00:49:47.023 --> 00:49:51.084
Sharpay, I have already told you.
That singing isnt really my thing.


00:49:51.099 --> 00:49:55.005
Here is the best news,
all the Redhawks will be there.


00:49:55.020 --> 00:49:56.034
Really?
Of course.


00:49:56.054 --> 00:49:58.071
We will lock up your
scholarship with a high C......


00:49:58.088 --> 00:50:00.054
....right from centre stage.


00:50:03.012 --> 00:50:06.059
We are all in this together, right?
Your parents have been really really nice, Sharpay.


00:50:07.039 --> 00:50:09.051
Singing with you is not a part of my job.


00:50:09.071 --> 00:50:13.015
No. just something you promised to do.


00:50:13.044 --> 00:50:14.036
Remember?


00:50:17.041 --> 00:50:19.066
You look fabulous in your
new clothes by the way.


00:50:20.081 --> 00:50:22.061
Do you like the shoes?
There Italian.


00:50:22.082 --> 00:50:23.062
Nice.


00:50:27.025 --> 00:50:28.070
Let me show you
how this is done.


00:50:28.090 --> 00:50:32.000
Its really easy.
Just line up your target.


00:50:32.020 --> 00:50:33.071
Now easy back swing.


00:50:34.033 --> 00:50:35.049
Hey Gab!
Hey.


00:50:41.061 --> 00:50:44.083
That girl has more moves than an
octopus in a wrestling match.


00:50:45.060 --> 00:50:48.063
Nah, he knows how to swim.
Yeah, Troy can handle himself.


00:50:49.037 --> 00:50:52.021
I did over hear him asking for
her opinion, on his new....


00:50:52.040 --> 00:50:56.013
.... Italian golf shoes.
He didnt ask me.


00:50:56.036 --> 00:50:59.030
So wake up sister. She is
basically offering him a college education.


00:50:59.051 --> 00:51:01.097
Just so he will sing with
her in the talent show.


00:51:02.042 --> 00:51:05.094
Troy would never do that.
You got eyes, use them.


00:51:06.017 --> 00:51:08.066
Lets go eat.
Yeah I gotta go.


00:51:09.055 --> 00:51:10.093
See you later?
Ok.


00:51:12.037 --> 00:51:16.029
You take it back, then through.
Troy, Fulton wants you in the lobby.


00:51:16.047 --> 00:51:18.005
Fantastic. Thank you. Cya.


00:51:29.056 --> 00:51:32.035
.... And she steps on the ball.....


00:51:33.083 --> 00:51:36.072
Troy Bolton this is.....
Ive seen them all play for the university.


00:51:36.090 --> 00:51:40.046
Alright, come scrimage at our gym.
It will be good for your game.


00:51:40.092 --> 00:51:43.089
Play with you guys?
Yeah lets get down, bro.


00:51:45.007 --> 00:51:46.083
Awesome
Alright.


00:51:47.029 --> 00:51:48.068
Lets all get some awesome lunch.


00:51:49.084 --> 00:51:51.054
I knew it, Coral Blue.


00:51:51.095 --> 00:51:54.091
It is perfect for your skin tone
And mine too.


00:51:55.009 --> 00:51:58.070
We are naturally skin tone compatible, Troy
I have no idea what that means.


00:51:58.088 --> 00:52:01.065
You dont need too
I am here for you.


00:52:02.062 --> 00:52:04.046
Whos hungry?
Lets eat!


00:52:04.064 --> 00:52:07.062
How can you hit the ball straight
if your club doesnt trust you?


00:52:07.080 --> 00:52:11.012
Thats the key. So its all in the grip,
you have to hold it just right.


00:52:11.034 --> 00:52:12.063
OOOOO That looks great!


00:52:12.084 --> 00:52:16.065
I almost forget.
I order swiss on my burger.


00:52:16.084 --> 00:52:18.016
Check it out man and try it.
Alright.


00:52:18.032 --> 00:52:21.033
There from the university.
Table 3 needs more ice tea.


00:52:22.023 --> 00:52:25.065
No, rotate your hands over the top. Put your
thumb on that side and there you go, man


00:52:25.084 --> 00:52:28.068
You good, I will see you on the course.
Yeah lets do it, man.


00:52:29.098 --> 00:52:32.065
Zeke, Yo Troy. One swiss.
Coming right up.


00:52:33.067 --> 00:52:36.014
I think your right, there is a guy out
there who looks just like Trou Bolton.


00:52:36.033 --> 00:52:38.036
But I have no idea who he really is.


00:52:48.075 --> 00:52:51.051
Kelsi has got some great new ideas
to spice up the talent show.....


00:52:51.076 --> 00:52:54.053
Eye on the results.
That new duet that Troy and Gabriella sing.


00:52:54.071 --> 00:52:55.038
I need it.


00:52:55.058 --> 00:52:57.038
Actually its not available.


00:52:57.070 --> 00:52:58.062
Repeat.


00:52:58.085 --> 00:53:02.010
Its something I wrote for Troy
and Gabriella, just in case they decided.....


00:53:02.028 --> 00:53:06.094
Your an employee
Not! a fairy god mother. Lets have it.


00:53:08.074 --> 00:53:12.011
Transpose it in to my key.
Troy and I will be doing it in the talent show.


00:53:13.023 --> 00:53:16.030
Oh and run up the tempo.
We will need to keep people awake.


00:53:16.052 --> 00:53:19.076
What about our song, what about Humuhumuh?
Change of plans.


00:53:20.025 --> 00:53:22.090
What am I meant to do with
my tikki warrior outfit?


00:53:23.010 --> 00:53:25.053
Save it for Halloween,
Go to a luau, or sell it online.


00:53:25.070 --> 00:53:29.090
Dont know. But in the meantime
keep an  eye on those Wildcats.


00:53:30.009 --> 00:53:31.077
If there planning on
being in the show.


00:53:31.096 --> 00:53:34.023
Which I doubt, once they
find out about Troy and me.


00:53:34.046 --> 00:53:37.058
I dont want any suprises.
Oh and dont worry.


00:53:37.080 --> 00:53:42.011
I will find a song for you somewhere
in the show, or the next show.


00:53:42.030 --> 00:53:43.037
Really?


00:53:45.036 --> 00:53:47.018
Dont strain yourself, Slick.


00:53:50.038 --> 00:53:52.067
Entertainers are so temperamental.


00:53:53.039 --> 00:53:54.076
Transpose!


00:54:06.006 --> 00:54:07.007
Look at you!


00:54:08.031 --> 00:54:09.018
Go team!


00:54:10.032 --> 00:54:12.012
Its a gift from the guys.


00:54:12.085 --> 00:54:14.019
The guys?


00:54:14.088 --> 00:54:17.033
Oh, you know those tall people.


00:54:19.026 --> 00:54:21.011
Look, I have got
to go in a minute.


00:54:21.031 --> 00:54:24.015
I will be back within an hour and
i will pick you up in m y new truck.


00:54:24.039 --> 00:54:26.034
We will go to a movie. I promise.


00:54:27.090 --> 00:54:31.004
A promise is a really big word, Troy.


00:54:31.098 --> 00:54:34.078
Yeah, I know.
We also have the staff Baseball game....


00:54:34.098 --> 00:54:37.076
.... to work. remember
that you would play?


00:54:37.097 --> 00:54:41.031
Right, Right baseball.
I will absolutely meet you there.


00:54:41.050 --> 00:54:44.068
You forgot didnt you?
No, I just got the days mixed up.


00:54:44.088 --> 00:54:47.026
Sorry I couldnt make lunch today.


00:54:47.082 --> 00:54:49.008
Its just been completely wild.


00:54:49.032 --> 00:54:52.032
You know? I cant believe how
things are working out here.


00:54:52.064 --> 00:54:58.021
I see. Italian golf shoes,
new clothes. Golf carts.


00:54:58.043 --> 00:55:01.077
Its crazy stuff. Its hard to
keep track of it all I bet.


00:55:02.070 --> 00:55:06.004
So whats your point?M It just doesnt seem like new stuff.


00:55:06.084 --> 00:55:08.038
Its like a new Troy.


00:55:09.018 --> 00:55:12.069
Alright. Lets see if Tiger Woods
still has a jump shot?


00:55:12.087 --> 00:55:15.092
Hey Bolton, come on.
Hey.


00:55:16.011 --> 00:55:18.016
Tell them to come over here and mix it up?
We will show them some game.


00:55:18.033 --> 00:55:20.069
You know, I dont think that is how they roll.


00:55:20.086 --> 00:55:23.011
How they roll?
No, No that is not what I meant.


00:55:23.028 --> 00:55:25.076
Its a closed practise, I am sorry.


00:55:26.079 --> 00:55:29.084
Maybe you can get us a video.
Bolton, come on.


00:55:30.001 --> 00:55:32.078
I thought we were going to play two on two
after work before the baseball game.


00:55:32.094 --> 00:55:35.066
I know, I know man.
I am sorry.


00:55:36.067 --> 00:55:40.022
Come on, Zeke that was from yesterday.
When we were all on a team!


00:55:41.064 --> 00:55:43.038
Hey, how is it going?


00:55:44.075 --> 00:55:46.006
Its my ball.


00:55:52.050 --> 00:55:53.046
lets go guys.


00:55:54.039 --> 00:55:57.099
Would you guys be mad at me, if I asked him to
get me one of those cool red jackets?


00:56:01.022 --> 00:56:02.077
Hey, come on.


00:56:08.089 --> 00:56:12.085
Im so excited about they game.
Hey Ryan!


00:56:13.010 --> 00:56:14.034
No rehersals?


00:56:14.078 --> 00:56:17.045
Nope, my sister is working
up something new.


00:56:17.063 --> 00:56:19.043
So are you coming to the baseball game?


00:56:20.029 --> 00:56:21.064
Im not staff.


00:56:22.011 --> 00:56:24.087
I wasnt invited.
Hey, everyone is invited.


00:56:25.006 --> 00:56:26.067
Come on, hop in.


00:56:27.076 --> 00:56:28.080
Alright.


00:56:30.073 --> 00:56:31.063
Are you in.


00:56:38.003 --> 00:56:39.030
Hi Martha, Hi Kelsi.


00:56:50.029 --> 00:56:52.003
What Fulton sent you
here to spy on us?


00:56:52.035 --> 00:56:55.056
No, my sister did. She thinks your going
to upstage her in the talent show.


00:56:55.074 --> 00:56:58.098
No worries. We were going to do
the show but Troy bailed on us.


00:56:59.019 --> 00:57:01.052
Whatever.
What do you mean whatever?


00:57:01.074 --> 00:57:03.013
Its our summer, remember?


00:57:03.034 --> 00:57:05.054
I thought we decided that
doing the show would be fun.


00:57:05.073 --> 00:57:06.084
